---
---

<section id="clinical" class="py-24 sm:py-36 bg-[#F8FAFC] border-t border-slate-200">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 sm:px-12 lg:px-16">
    
    <!-- Section Header -->
    <div class="max-w-3xl mb-16 scroll-reveal">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5 mb-4">
        <span class="w-6 h-[2px] bg-[#00A396] scroll-line"></span>
        <span class="font-mono text-xs font-bold tracking-widest text-[#00A396] uppercase">
          CHAPTER 02 / CLINICAL EVIDENCE & MATRIX
        </span>
      </div>
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-black text-slate-900 tracking-tight leading-tight">
        장벽 없는 조기 발견을 위한<br />
        <span class="text-[#00A396]">안저 검사 기술 비교 (Comparison Matrix)</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="text-slate-600 text-base sm:text-lg mt-4 leading-relaxed">
        기존의 고가 거치형 장비나 숙련자가 필요한 핸드헬드 카메라와 달리, GazeInto는 완전한 비대면·자가 측정과 실시간 AI 분석을 실현했습니다.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Comparison Table -->
    <div class="bg-white rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 overflow-hidden shadow-sm mb-16 scroll-reveal">
      <div class="overflow-x-auto">
        <table class="w-full text-center border-collapse">
          <thead>
            <tr class="border-b border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-600">
              <th class="py-6 px-8 text-left font-bold text-slate-700">기기 유형 (Device Category)</th>
              <th class="py-6 px-8 font-semibold">Operator-free<br /><span class="text-[11px] text-slate-400 font-normal">전문 검사자 불필요</span></th>
              <th class="py-6 px-8 font-semibold">At-home use<br /><span class="text-[11px] text-slate-400 font-normal">재택 및 비대면 검사</span></th>
              <th class="py-6 px-8 font-semibold">Built-in AI<br /><span class="text-[11px] text-slate-400 font-normal">온디바이스 질환 판독 AI</span></th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody class="divide-y divide-slate-100 text-sm">
            <!-- Tabletop cameras -->
            <tr class="hover:bg-slate-50/60 transition-colors text-slate-500">
              <td class="py-6 px-8 text-left font-medium text-slate-600">
                거치형 안저 카메라 <span class="text-xs text-slate-400 font-normal font-mono">(Tabletop cameras)</span>
              </td>
              <td class="py-6 px-8 text-slate-300 font-bold text-lg">—</td>
              <td class="py-6 px-8 text-slate-300 font-bold text-lg">—</td>
              <td class="py-6 px-8 text-slate-300 font-bold text-lg">—</td>
            </tr>

            <!-- Handheld cameras -->
            <tr class="hover:bg-slate-50/60 transition-colors text-slate-500">
              <td class="py-6 px-8 text-left font-medium text-slate-600">
                휴대용 핸드헬드 카메라 <span class="text-xs text-slate-400 font-normal font-mono">(Handheld cameras)</span>
              </td>
              <td class="py-6 px-8 text-slate-300 font-bold text-lg">—</td>
              <td class="py-6 px-8 text-slate-300 font-bold text-lg">—</td>
              <td class="py-6 px-8 text-slate-300 font-bold text-lg">—</td>
            </tr>

            <!-- GazeInto Inc. (Highlighted Feature Row) -->
            <tr class="bg-slate-900 text-white shadow-xl relative z-10">
              <td class="py-7 px-8 text-left text-white flex items-center gap-3">
                <div class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-[#00C4B4] shadow-[0_0_10px_#00C4B4] animate-pulse"></div>
                <div>
                  <span class="text-base sm:text-lg text-white font-extrabold font-display block">GazeInto Inc.</span>
                  <span class="text-xs text-[#22D3EE] font-mono font-normal">XR Fundus Camera & AI Engine</span>
                </div>
              </td>
              <td class="py-7 px-8 text-[#00C4B4] text-2xl font-black drop-shadow-sm">✓</td>
              <td class="py-7 px-8 text-[#00C4B4] text-2xl font-black drop-shadow-sm">✓</td>
              <td class="py-7 px-8 text-[#00C4B4] text-2xl font-black drop-shadow-sm">✓</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Targeted Diseases Callout -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 mb-20 scroll-reveal">
      <div class="p-8 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-200 hover:border-[#00A396]/50 transition-all shadow-sm">
        <span class="font-mono text-xs font-bold text-[#00A396] uppercase mb-2 block">Disease 01</span>
        <h4 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">황반변성 (Macular Degeneration)</h4>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-500 leading-relaxed">망막 중심부 드루젠(Drusen) 및 신생혈관 이상 징후를 조기에 포착합니다.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="p-8 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-200 hover:border-[#00A396]/50 transition-all shadow-sm">
        <span class="font-mono text-xs font-bold text-[#00A396] uppercase mb-2 block">Disease 02</span>
        <h4 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">녹내장 (Glaucoma)</h4>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-500 leading-relaxed">시신경 유두 함몰비(CDR) 정밀 계측을 통해 시신경 손상을 선제 검출합니다.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="p-8 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-200 hover:border-[#00A396]/50 transition-all shadow-sm">
        <span class="font-mono text-xs font-bold text-[#00A396] uppercase mb-2 block">Disease 03</span>
        <h4 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">당뇨망막병증 (Diabetic Retinopathy)</h4>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-500 leading-relaxed">미세혈관류, 출혈점 및 망막 삼출물을 AI가 정량 어노테이션합니다.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Pre-Footer Global Partner Callout Banner (Improvement 4) -->
    <div class="p-10 sm:p-14 rounded-3xl bg-white border border-slate-200 shadow-sm flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-8 scroll-reveal">
      <div class="max-w-xl text-center md:text-left">
        <span class="font-mono text-xs font-bold text-[#00A396] tracking-widest uppercase mb-2 block">GLOBAL PARTNERSHIP</span>
        <h3 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 mb-3 tracking-tight">
          어디서나 가능한 안저 스크리닝,<br class="hidden sm:inline" />
          GazeInto와 함께하세요.
        </h3>
        <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">
          국내외 안과 병원, 검안 센터, 요양 기관 및 글로벌 파트너사를 위한 맞춤 PoC 데모를 지원합니다.
        </p>
      </div>

      <button
        type="button"
        onclick="window.openContactModal('b2b')"
        class="shrink-0 px-8 py-4 rounded-xl bg-[#0F2236] hover:bg-[#1A334E] text-white text-sm font-bold tracking-tight shadow-sm transition-all duration-200 hover:-translate-y-0.5 flex items-center gap-2"
      >
        <span>도입 및 파트너십 문의하기</span>
        <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-[#00C4B4]" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.5" d="M14 5l7 7m0 0l-7 7m7-7H3"/>
        </svg>
      </button>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>
